        "id": "a740854b-88b1-419b-804b-a1e710213b2d",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Based on the provided reports for Brew & Bean Coffee Co.:\n\n* **Line Item:** Total Revenue [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1:table-1]\n* **Q3 2024:** $76,000 [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1:table-1], [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1]\n* **Q4 2024:** $84,000 [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1:table-1], [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1]\n* **Calculated Growth:** Total revenue increased by **$8,000** (from $76,000 to $84,000), representing a **+10.5%** quarter-over-quarter growth [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1:table-1], [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1].\n\nThis growth made Q4 the strongest quarter of the year, supported by steady growth in coffee and beverage sales through the year and a modest increase in foot traffic [tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1].",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1:table-1",
            "source_file": "quarterly_report_q4_2024.pdf",
            "snippet": "| Metric (USD) | Q3 2024 | Q4 2024 | Change (%) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Total Revenue | $76,000 | $84,000 | +10.5% |\n| Gross Profit | $48,000 | $53,400 | +11.2% |\n| Operating Expenses | $34,200 | $36,700 | +7.3% |\n| Net Income | $10,760 | $13,080 | +21.6% |"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1",
            "source_file": "quarterly_report_q4_2024.pdf",
            "snippet": "Brew & Bean Coffee Co.\nQuarterly Financial Report - Q4 2024\nQuarter ended December 31, 2024 | Prepared by the Owner/Manager | Unaudited\nSummary\nQ4 was the strongest quarter of the year. Total revenue was $84,000, up +10.5% from $76,000 in Q3. Net\nincome rose to $13,080 from $10,760 (+21.6%), helped by steady growth in coffee and beverage sales through\nthe year.\nFinancial Highlights\nRevenue by Category (Q4 2024)\nCommentary\nCoffee and beverage sales continued to grow steadily each quarter, supported by a modest increase in foot\ntraffic. Marketing spend rose to $3,000 in Q4 to support a holiday drinks promotion, the main driver of the\nincrease in operating expenses.\nNote: figures are unaudited and presented for internal use only.\nBrew & Bean Coffee Co. | Quarterly Report Q4 2024 | Synthetic demo data Page 1"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "tmpa9w0ix92.pdf:page-1:table-2",
            "source_file": "quarterly_report_q4_2024.pdf",
            "snippet": "| Category | Q4 2024 | % of Revenue |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Coffee & Beverage Sales | $51,000 | 60.7% |\n| Pastry & Food Sales | $23,500 | 28.0% |\n| Merchandise & Beans (Retail Bags) | $9,500 | 11.3% |"
          }
        ],
